From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:46:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 609/612] perf(attention,model): trim activation and MXFP8 cast
 lifetimes across attention and decoder layer

Drop live references to intermediate activations and MXFP8 cast buffers across DeepseekV4Attention and DeepseekV4DecoderLayer as soon as their last consumer finishes, so PyTorch's caching allocator can reuse their blocks before the output projection and MoE layer allocate.
---
